## ✨ Highlights

- **Bit-Exact Survivor Weights:** All {{ artifact.n_routed | int }} surviving routed experts per decoder layer retain their exact upstream packed OCP MXFP4 (E2M1 weights + E8M0 scales) bytes from `{{ base.repo }}` (`{{ base.revision }}`), alongside the unmodified FP8 dense MLA/DSA path, shared expert, hyper-connections, vision tower/aligner, and 3 DSpark/MTP layers.
- **HOPE Co-Activation Pruning with Drift Guards:** Selected via `{{ keepset.A.winner }}` across a {{ corpus.tokens_total | int }}-token multi-domain calibration corpus (with Engram enabled), protecting domain-specific and `bias_vl` vision experts at the measured `{{ arb.knee_A }}` protect-fraction knee while locking Super-Experts and position-sensitive attention-sink experts against long-context drift.
- **Pre-Registered Gate Governance:** Evaluated on {{ s10.tokens_scored | int }} held-out confirmation tokens across {{ s10.n_docs | int }} documents against the unpruned teacher (`ops/s10_gates.json`, sha256 `{{ s10.gates_sha256 | short }}`).

